Chromium 158.0.8127.37 -> 158.0.8127.65, for the 158.0.8127.37 tarball.

158.0.8127.65 is a tag on the 158 branch (refs/branch-heads/8127@{#1825}) that
has no source tarball (as of 2026-11-17). It adds 133 branch commits to
158.0.8127.37 (#1692), 107 of them not PGO/orderfile/AFDO rolls, translation
updates or VERSION changes. Besides those of 158.0.8127.64 (#1779), they are
security fixes in File System Access (.git writes), the CacheStorage side-data
writer for sandboxed workers, Oilpan's HeapVector bulk operations, PointerEvent
retargeting across shadow boundaries, Safe Browsing's phishing visual extractor,
EditorCommand's Document binding, CSSAnimations::Cancel during style updates,
re-entrant navigations during CommitNavigation, customized element upgrades,
FormatBlockCommand, FidoHidDevice's error callbacks, and in the dependency rolls:
ICU's DecNum allocation failures, LevelDB's block entry lengths, V8's literal
dictionary walk, Maglev merge-point SBXCHECK, cross-context Object.create IC,
class initializer reparsing, JSGlobalProxy ObjectCreateMap and ShortPrint
recursion, Skia's AA subset clamping and image filter hashing, ANGLE's PowerVR
workarounds and pixel local storage FBO completeness, Dawn's oversized copy
strides and Tint's infinite-loop prevention; plus WebUI permission chips, PWA
menu items, the Wayland activation token surface and other branch merges.

